  "annotations_dropped": [
    {
      "annotation_id": "8217781da8454ff1a9c15b01abfa8744_10",
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "labels": [
        "RLC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_labels:RLC"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "2 In its order dated 30 September 2024, a Division Bench of the Madras High Court,\nrecorded that it had examined both the detenues and the petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6c04b376b8d843babf6cabfbec025f5e_25",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "9 At this stage, based on our interaction with the two individuals and after considering the submissions, we are of the view that the ends of justice would require the following order :\n(i) Habeas Corpus Petition No 2487 of 2024 shall stand"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4d6e854defaf4e948ec4bfe43c2f5487_26",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "We permit the first respondent,\nwho is the original petitioner before the High Court, to appear through the video conferencing platform, if he wishes to interact with the Court in person or through counsel either on the same platform or phy"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "667fc6093f5046ab8e9cf7b66aa14ea1_32",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Since the High Court did not specifically advert to what transpired during the course of their interaction with the Bench, this Court interacted on the video-conferencing platform with the two individuals in respect of whom the Habeas Corpu"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8110f64267e844fea88b9044a7859be1_37",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n6 The status report which has been filed by the Superintendent of Police specifically adverts to the two individuals in Paragraphs 23 to 30, which are reproduced below:\n23."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "893a389d9a6c410ab094281b5b1c43ae_38",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is respectfully submitted that in his affidavit filed in H.C.P. No. 2487 of 2024,\nthe 1st respondent has raised concerns about the nutrition and mental wellness of his two daughters."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "723520c61bc347f5b7a03668a8e0706e_39",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In this regard, the alleged detenues Geetha Kamraj @ MAA MATHI and Latha Kamaraj @ MAA MAAYU were enquired personally by Assistant SP Ms.\nShristi Singh on 02.10.2024 and they submitted their written submission where they have stated that th"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "46029617a3c547bd93d8421c374eb6f8_40",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The written submissions of both MAA MATHI and MAA MAAYU are herewith produced for the perusal of this Honourable Court."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4baeeadc53ae46f6987d58d8a5aefe53_41",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "24. Further I submit that there were phone calls made between the parents and daughters."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "90005ebb492e43ba96979907ca0514ae_42",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "There are totally 10 calls made between the petitioner and the said Geetha Kamaraj @ MAA MATHI in this year 2024 and 70 calls are being made between the wife of the petitioner and the said Geetha Kamaraj @ MAA MATHI."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "eb87699d17f24c65ab8d9b70275a00f1_43",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "On the said date of 15.06.2024 calls were made by the said Geetha Kamaraj @ MAA MATHI to her father and mother."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1c0a660df601403c860cb4fa8967a543_44",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "She spoke to her father for 126 second and a seven seconds call was made by the said Latha Kamaraj to the mobile number of the petitioner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8f73bd5275bc4145b41a7c59ef6d7a4b_45",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The alleged detenues Geetha Kamaraj @ MAA MATHI and Latha Kamaraj @ MAA MAAYU were personally enquired by me about the allegations of mental torture or commission of any offences as raised by the petitioner in his affidavit."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d256a6eb31104debbf1b7f0ad4e8e9f6_46",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "25. In reply, the said MAA MATHI and MAA MAAYU stated that they are living happily in Isha Yoga Centre in the path of monkhood and they requested their parents to not to tell any lies about them and the institution in public and not to dist"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8b8b450d602f4e2d95ee724704c3b9cf_47",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "But the petitioner did not show ears to their requests and continue to humiliate them in public."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9e3d11eb12604d009f6e523a9987bf56_48",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Both MAA MAAYU had confirmed that she did not skip her meal and she was not in fasting until death."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9879b99b173f419cac45603d54510198_49",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "She confirmed that she told her sister MAA MATHI to inform the petitioner that she would go fasting only to restrain him from making false statement in public about them and the path of monkhood in the institution."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "04e0da5d325b437490e66eddc5cafed0_50",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "26. Further the said MAA MAAYU and MAA MATHI have stated that they are meeting their parents often and the relationship between them went fine."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "de5c5da7f9f64a6baea1e7e0ee467656_51",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Even the said two daughters met their parents on 07.06.2024 on the occasion of their anniversary."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "75ad1305aa0549139dcd33c9fcb3b421_52",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In these circumstances, on 14.06.2024 their father Dr. Kamaraj accompanied the persons who tried to get inside Isha Yoga Centre as a result of which Cr.No.94 of 2024 was registered against the members of Petitioner Foundation."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6ec6ab72a44e4cb8854e686954db61f7_58",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The said MAA MAAYU is in good heath condition and she even participated in 10 km marathon and the photographs taken in the event are produced herewith for the perusal of this Honourable Court."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e6613c0d88d34eb586e83d423713fd69_61",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The circumstances under which the said F.I.R.\nwas registered"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7da71253de6442b7910a33e77a122e0e_66",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "29. I further submit that out of total 217 Brahmacharis/monks, 30 brahmacharis were enquired and all those 30 monks are well educated and they are in good health physically and mentally."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b6030857832e41e899a1750a54237702_67",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Further the said MAA MATHI and MAA MAAYU also gave their hand-written submissions."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "30554a8b25334841b79c26bb1eedc5a7_68",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In their statements, they have mentioned that they chose the path on their own Will and they are not being compelled to stay in the premises of Petitioner Foundation."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b48849dc1c304ae89167e2f7140e83ef_69",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "30. Further I submit that the Brahmacharis have stated that they are free to go anywhere when they please and they meet their friends and relatives at anytime they please and there is no obstruction from the Petitioner Foundation for their "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "eab30e906471434d8ce70940bdc29f92_70",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "7 Both the individuals have attained the age of majority."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "698f966874fd4ee89ccefcac0a8c36e6_71",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "They were majors even when they joined the Ashram."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3b2150673c794cc3bed4c5ece11402e6_72",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "They have expressed their clear inclination to continue at Isha Foundation at Coimbatore."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1c9c0e5ea6b84e4ab395c024b4e83f54_73",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In this view, the purpose of the Habeas Corpus Petition is duly fulfilled."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "591ff8e4c62c4e7a8048ac5b25064232_74",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "No further directions were necessary by the High Court."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f9611e6789824eec89084bb90a128015_75",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n8 Having said this, it is necessary to record that in pursuance of the direction of the High Court, a status report has been filed by the Superintendent of Police, as noted above."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9ae14f31577d441cbadbcc225d373691_76",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The status report was directed to be filed before this Court."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "bb770f510c764e058e029320b3ff7804_77",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The status report is based on the enquiry which was conducted Isha Foundation vs S. Kamaraj on 18 October, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/146086139/\n6 by a team of officers of the Coimbatore Police till then."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c7abb19b094e4e99a4d9fd860a358ed9_78",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n9 The jurisdiction of the Court under Article 226 of the Constitution, while dealing with a habeas corpus petition, is well-defined."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "504500f76f3c44a1a5ccc56bd7be552a_79",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It would be unnecessary for this Court to expand the ambit of these proceedings which arose from the habeas corpus petition filed before the High Court of Judicature at Madras."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0306f6513fe1423295ba10a2fab5a77d_80",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "We clarify that the only aspect of the matter which has been dealt with in these proceedings pertains to the habeas corpus petition and that aspect of the matter shall stand closed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "19eb094bb99143bb8de99960db2202bb_81",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nHabeas Corpus Petition No 2487 of 2024, which has been directed to be transferred to this Court,\nshall stand disposed of."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "39ced453e4b64b31aae2a9266850ad44_82",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "10 The closure of these proceedings, it is clarified, will not affect any other regulatory compliances which are required to be achieved by Isha Foundation."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f955ead234884752b7fcdaff910ed9bf_83",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Mr Mukul Rohatgi,\nsenior counsel appearing on behalf of Isha Foundation, with Mr V Giri, senior counsel, states that any such requirements would be duly complied with in accordance with law."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5cfbd6540efe49f1b81201b72314445c_84",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "11 The Special Leave Petition shall accordingly stand disposed of."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "fe66174673754b17827b2be816413a45_85",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "12 Applications for intervention/impleadment are dismissed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9c1a7491e4584998abda7a9592712a66_86",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "13 Other pending applications stand disposed of."
    }
